' @startuml Browser Token Flow (Future: Auth Code + Email Verification)
' actor User
' participant Browser
' participant Angular
' participant nginx
' participant BFF as "Node.js BFF"
' participant Redis
' participant Keycloak
' participant FHIR

' == Registration (email verification required) ==
' User -> Browser : Sign up
' Browser -> Angular : Navigate to Registration page
' Angular -> Browser : Show registration form
' Browser -> Angular : Fill registration form 
' Angular -> nginx : POST /auth/register
' nginx -> BFF : forward
' BFF -> Keycloak : Create user (emailVerified=false)
' Keycloak -> User : Send verification email (link)
' User -> Keycloak : Click verification link
' Keycloak -> Keycloak : Mark emailVerified=true
' Keycloak -> Browser : Verification success page
' Browser -> Angular : Navigate to Login page
' Angular -> Browser : Show login form
' note right: login isn't automatic as user must verify email first

' '
' @enduml
